# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in.
#
# The Application (client) ID from your Entra app registration.
# ⚠️ Register the redirect `feast://auth` under "Mobile and desktop applications",
# NOT "Single-page application" — an spa-typed redirect caps refresh tokens at 24 hours
# instead of 90 days (SPEC §4.4). No client secret: this is a public client using PKCE.
EXPO_PUBLIC_MS_CLIENT_ID=
